{"pageid": 504, "title": "Octo", "revid": 2650, "categories": ["Characters", "Totems", "Monsters", "Oscuratypes", "Characters (SIKTC comics)"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Octo</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/0/00/Octo.png/revision/latest?cb=20241130202045\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Octo\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/0/00/Octo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241130202045\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/0/00/Octo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241130202045 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/0/00/Octo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20241130202045 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Octo\" width=\"270\" height=\"223\" data-image-key=\"Octo.png\" data-image-name=\"Octo.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Biographical Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Phantasmatype\" title=\"Phantasmatype\">Phantasmatype</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Oscuratype\" title=\"Oscuratype\">Oscuratype</a> <small>(formerly)</small></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occupation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Totem\" title=\"Totem\">Totem</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_1\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 1\">Something is Killing the Children #1</a></i></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_40\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 40\">Something is Killing the Children #40</a></i></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Octo</b> is a high-level <a href=\"/wiki/Phantasmatypes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Phantasmatypes\">Phantasmatype</a> monster bound to the hunter <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a>. Originally an <a href=\"/wiki/Oscuratypes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Oscuratypes\">Oscuratype</a> that killed her parents and best friend, Octo was taken down by a young Erica and her future mentor, <a href=\"/wiki/Jessica_Slaughter\" title=\"Jessica Slaughter\">Jessica Slaughter</a>, and bound to Erica's octopus plush. Bound to Erica by ritual, Octo is now her familiar, something that he dislikes due to his desire to cause more violence. He often tries to get Erica or other characters to get themselves killed in order to witness the fallout. Despite this, he and Erica are inseparable; while she often says that she wants to burn him, she never does so. \n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_2\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 2\">Issue #2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_5\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 5\">Issue #5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_7\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 7\">Issue #7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_9\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 9\">Issue #9</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_13\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 13\">Issue #14</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_16\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 16\">Issue #16</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_17\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 17\">Issue #17</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_18\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 18\">Issue #18</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_19\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 19\">Issue #19</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_20\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 20\">Issue #20</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_22\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 22\">Issue #22</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_24\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 24\">Issue #24</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_25\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 25\">Issue #25</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_26\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 26\">Issue #26</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_27\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 27\">Issue #27</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_28\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 28\">Issue #28</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_29\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 29\">Issue #29</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"a33fb8d550687fb7f33dc436edc3a66b\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_16SanctumSanctorumA_Cover-jp